  <h1>CircleLedger</h1>

  <p>
    A free, private tool for savings circles (<em>esusu</em>, <em>sou-sou</em>, partner).
  </p>

  <p>
    CircleLedger helps members keep shared records of contributions — without apps, accounts, or data collection.
  </p>

  <div class="note">
    <strong>How it works:</strong><br>
    • Each member logs their own payments in a shared notebook or WhatsApp group.<br>
    • At payout time, the group reviews the record together.<br>
    • No central admin. No interest. No platform.
  </div>

  <p>
    This is not a financial service. It is a practice of mutual trust.
  </p>

